### Create User Manager

This API endpoint is used to create a user manager with the provided user details and environment information.

#### Request Body

- software_id (string): The code of the software for Engine.

- user (object):

    - mail (string): The email of the user.

    - firstname (string): The first name of the user.

    - lastname (string): The last name of the user.

    - hash_run (string): The hash run of the user.

    - profile (string): The profile of the user.

- wevy_id (string): The Wevy ID.

- environment_code (string): The environment code.

- action (string): The action to be performed (e.g., create).

- country (string): The country code of the client.

- region (string): The datacenter region.

- url_access (string): The URL for accessing the environment.


#### Response (JSON Schema)

``` json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "status": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "message": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "user_id": {
      "type": "string"
    }
  }
}

 ```

